reliability: offered (rows) x requested (columns)
              BEST_EFFORT   RELIABLE     
BEST_EFFORT   ok            incompatible 
RELIABLE      ok            ok           
durability: offered (rows) x requested (columns)
                 VOLATILE         TRANSIENT_LOCAL 
VOLATILE         ok               incompatible    
TRANSIENT_LOCAL  ok               ok              
topic /scan  type LaserScan
  publishers: 1
    node lidar_driver reliability=BEST_EFFORT durability=VOLATILE history=KEEP_LAST(5) deadline=infinite liveliness=AUTOMATIC
  subscriptions: 2
    node mapper       reliability=RELIABLE durability=VOLATILE history=KEEP_LAST(10) deadline=infinite liveliness=AUTOMATIC
    node viewer       reliability=BEST_EFFORT durability=VOLATILE history=KEEP_LAST(5) deadline=infinite liveliness=AUTOMATIC
  match lidar_driver -> mapper: INCOMPATIBLE
      reliability: offered BEST_EFFORT < requested RELIABLE
  match lidar_driver -> viewer: compatible
late joiner: publisher TRANSIENT_LOCAL depth 1 sent 3 samples before the subscriber TRANSIENT_LOCAL depth 1 appeared -> receives 1 old sample(s): 3..3
late joiner: publisher VOLATILE depth 1 sent 3 samples before the subscriber VOLATILE depth 1 appeared -> receives no old samples, only new ones
late joiner: publisher TRANSIENT_LOCAL depth 5 sent 8 samples before the subscriber TRANSIENT_LOCAL depth 3 appeared -> receives 3 old sample(s): 6..8
topic /cmd_vel  type Twist
  publishers: 1
    node teleop       reliability=RELIABLE durability=VOLATILE history=KEEP_LAST(10) deadline=100ms liveliness=AUTOMATIC
  subscriptions: 1
    node base         reliability=RELIABLE durability=VOLATILE history=KEEP_LAST(10) deadline=50ms liveliness=AUTOMATIC
  match teleop -> base: INCOMPATIBLE
      deadline: offered period 100 ms > requested 50 ms
deadline: publishing every 100 ms, requested deadline 40 ms, 1000 ms -> 20 deadline-missed event(s)
